# Build Brief: SaaS Pharmacy POS & Business Operating System

Build a production-quality **multi-tenant SaaS Pharmacy POS** designed initially for small and medium-sized retail pharmacies/chemists in Kenya.

The immediate customer problem is simple:

> **A pharmacy needs to sell products quickly and collect M-Pesa payments directly from the POS through STK Push, while automatically keeping inventory, sales, and business records accurate.**

This is NOT just a generic POS. It should be designed as the foundation for a future **AI-powered pharmacy/business operating system**.

---

## 1. Product Vision

Build:

**A modern cloud pharmacy POS that handles sales, M-Pesa payments, inventory, purchasing, expiry management, staff operations, and business intelligence from one system.**

The long-term direction is:

```text
POS
 ↓
Transactions
 ↓
Inventory + Customers + Suppliers
 ↓
Financial Intelligence
 ↓
AI Business Assistant
 ↓
Automation
```

The pharmacy owner should eventually be able to ask:

> "How is my business doing?"

> "What should I reorder?"

> "What products are expiring?"

> "Which products make me the most profit?"

> "Why did sales fall this week?"

> "How much did I make today?"

> "Send an STK Push to this customer."

> "Show me all stock expiring within 60 days."

The system should progressively evolve toward answering and executing these requests.

