# 4. User Roles

Implement RBAC.

### Owner/Admin

Can:

* view dashboard
* manage products
* manage inventory
* manage suppliers
* manage purchases
* manage users
* view reports
* view financial information
* configure M-Pesa
* manage branches
* view audit logs

### Pharmacist/Manager

Can:

* process sales
* manage inventory
* view products
* receive stock
* view reports

### Cashier

Can:

* create sales
* process payments
* send STK Push
* print receipts
* view permitted transaction history

Cashiers should NOT be able to arbitrarily modify prices, delete transactions, or manipulate inventory.

