# 6. Product Management

Each product should support:

* product name
* generic name
* category
* SKU
* barcode
* selling price
* buying price
* tax/VAT configuration
* unit
* supplier
* minimum stock level
* current stock
* active/inactive status

Pharmacy-specific information:

* batch number
* expiry date
* quantity per batch
* purchase price per batch

Do not treat inventory as a single number.

Inventory should be batch-aware.

Example:

```text
Paracetamol 500mg

Batch A
Quantity: 120
Expiry: 2026-11-30

Batch B
Quantity: 250
Expiry: 2027-06-30
```

