# 12. M-Pesa Integration

Build the M-Pesa integration behind a clean service abstraction.

Example:

```text
PaymentService
    |
    └── MpesaService
          ├── initiate_stk_push()
          ├── process_callback()
          ├── query_transaction()
          └── reconcile_transaction()
```

Never put M-Pesa business logic directly inside frontend components.

Use asynchronous callback/webhook handling.

Maintain payment states such as:

```text
PENDING
SUCCESS
FAILED
CANCELLED
TIMEOUT
REVERSED
```

Every payment should have a unique internal reference.

