# 13. Offline Resilience

A pharmacy cannot stop selling because the internet temporarily disappears.

Design the POS so that the frontend can gracefully handle connectivity problems.

At minimum:

* cache product data
* preserve an active cart
* prevent accidental duplicate sales
* clearly indicate connectivity status
* synchronize safe operations when connectivity returns

For M-Pesa specifically, clearly communicate that STK Push requires connectivity.

