# 15. Auditability

Every sensitive action should be auditable.

Track:

* user
* action
* entity
* previous value
* new value
* timestamp
* branch
* tenant

Examples:

```text
Price changed
Stock adjusted
Sale voided
Discount applied
User created
Product deleted/deactivated
Purchase received
Payment status changed
```

Never silently mutate financial records.

Prefer immutable financial transactions and reversal/void mechanisms.

